{"date":"2026-11-15","caps":[[0.05,"Arnie Jordan here, coming to you from row three at Jordan Arena, with the Rinkside Report."],[5.23,"Sunday, November fifteenth."],[6.82,"Last week my nephew said we try crayons, so I came with a coffee, the notebook, and the big box."],[12.34,"Sixty-four colours! Thirty-seven goals. You'd think that's plenty. You would be wrong."],[17.9,"The early game, the J.E. Culp Habs against the Timbit Senators."],[21.39,"Dixon opened it, Williams tied it, and Tuby put the Habs back up."],[24.99,"Then, with two seconds left in the first, Greg Penney scored all by himself. Two seconds."],[29.9,"That's not a goal, that's a doorbell ditch."],[32.94,"Then the Habs went to the buffet and didn't come back. KP, thirty-six seconds into the second."],[38.09,"Holt got one back. Cooke. Deakin."],[39.93,"Then Greg Penney, Tuby and Dixon, three goals in three minutes, and Chinner made it nine to three."],[45.29,"Deakin got his second late. By then I'd used red, blue, white, a second red, and Burnt Sienna."],[50.44,"I don't know what Burnt Sienna is."],[52.33,"Buynink came out of the Senators net for Shannon halfway through, and the Habs said welcome, here's six more."],[58.95,"In the third, Williams and Simon Murphy made it nine to six. Then Hunt, and Ort. Eleven to six, final."],[64.56,"Tuby had five points, Dixon and Greg Penney four each."],[67.56,"Williams had two goals and two assists, a lovely night as long as you don't look up."],[72.19,"And Ort scored, set one up, and took three for roughing at the exact same second Schmidt took three for slashing."],[78.4,"Those two weren't battling, they were synchronizing watches."],[82.37,"Game two, The Keg Canucks against Dawson's Oilers. Adam Short and Beckett put the Canucks up two nothing."],[88.25,"Then the second period became the McPherson Show. McPherson from Mansion."],[92.37,"McPherson again, tie game, and on that same second both teams changed goalies."],[97.41,"Snihur went off for tripping, and the Canucks scored anyway. Koke, short-handed, from Pundy and Goodie."],[103.03,"McPherson got it back on the power play, three all. Then HoundDog sat three for too many men."],[108.12,"HoundDog, I counted, and the Oilers had plenty of fellas out there. That was the problem."],[112.98,"Colin Murphy scored right after it ran out, from Adam Short and Wes Short."],[117.04,"The Short to Short connection now comes with a Murphy extension."],[121.2,"McPherson tied it four all in the third. Four goals, every Oiler goal, and Mansion helped on all four."],[126.75,"That's not a line, that's a two-man band. Then New Guy scored, and a minute later New Guy scored again."],[132.35,"Six to four Canucks. McPherson, four goals and a loss. That's catching four fish and the boat sinks."],[137.78,"Goodie had four assists, and New Guy had three points, so fellas, he's not that new anymore."],[142.79,"And Dawson gave up four in front of a team named after him. Nobody respects the landlord."],[147.63,"Late in it, Mansion and Adam Short went off together for roughing."],[151.24,"Mansion couldn't find the puck, so he settled for Short."],[154.94,"The late game, the ColdBreak Leafs against the RegattaSport Nordiques. Pierce scored twenty-seven seconds in."],[160.75,"Brophy went off for hooking, and Lawrence scored short-handed anyway. Two short-handed goals in one night."],[166.4,"I don't own a crayon for that. Then Pierce got the power-play goal, from Steele. Two to one Leafs."],[172.26,"In the second, Collini went off for slashing, and the Nordiques made it count."],[176.72,"Rob DeBolster scored while he sat, and thirty-five seconds later Dykstra, three to two Nordiques."],[182.25,"Collini, one slash, two goals against. Bad exchange rate."],[185.52,"Mallet came out for Rosie, JMAC came out for Trigg, and Pulo made it four to two with fifty-eight seconds left in the period."],[193.29,"Langlois scored early in the third. Larry Penney got one back."],[196.65,"Then Moorzey scored from Regular and Lawrence, and on that same second, Brophy went off for roughing."],[202.09,"Brophy, your team is up by three, and you still needed a sit-down."],[205.66,"Six minutes in the box, most of anybody all night. Horton got one more for the Leafs, and that was it."],[211.16,"Six to four Nordiques. Last week the Leafs won with thirty-six seconds left."],[215.26,"This week they led after one and never saw the lead again."],[219.05,"Somewhere in there, a clearing attempt went so high it rang off the clock."],[223.09,"I didn't catch who shot it, and I'm not asking."],[225.68,"Then I set my coffee on the crayon box, and now Burnt Sienna smells like a double double."],[231.18,"So that's your week."],[232.34,"Eleven for the Habs, four for McPherson in a loss, and a New Guy who scored two and is still the New Guy."],[238.2,"By the late game I was writing Nordiques goals in Mauve. My nephew says next week, a whiteboard."],[243.55,"If I got your name wrong, or gave your goal to the fella beside you, take it up with the refs, the timekeeper, and how fast you guys skate out there."],[251.84,"Tape your sticks. This has been Arnie Jordan with the Rinkside Report."]],"pages":[["ROW 3 - 11/15","coffee #1","64 crayons!!","nephew: trust me"],["G1: Habs @ Sens","Habs 3 - Sens 1","Culp: 2 assists","Dixon 2G 2A!!","Williams 2G 2A!!"],["HABS 9 SENS 3","used: red, blue,","white, red again,","BURNT SIENNA??"],["Habs 11 - Sens 6  FINAL","Williams 2G 2A!!","Murphy 1G","Hunt 1G 1A","Ort 1G 1A"],["G2: Canucks @ Oilers","Canucks 2 - Oilers 2","Dawson: in, then out","Short 1G 1A","Beckett 1G 1A"],["Canucks 4 - Oilers 3","!Snihur: tripping","Koke 1G 1A","Short 1G 1A","Pundy: 2 assists"],["CANUCKS 6 OIL 4","McPherson: 4 G","Mansion: 4 A","= 2-man band","boat: sunk"],["G3: Leafs @ Nordiques","Leafs 2 - Nordiques 1","Pierce 2G 1A!!","!Brophy: hooking +1 more","Lawrence 1G 1A"],["NORDS 3 LEAFS 2","!Collini - slash","= 2 goals agst","bad exch. rate"],["Leafs 4 - Nordiques 6  FINAL","Langlois 1G","Penney 1G",